  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tropical Forest Initiative &#x2013; support to REDD+ Investment Programme phase II (RIP II) in Ethiopia, 2023-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REDD+ Investment Programme phase II (RIP II)&#x2019;s objective is to contribute to Ethiopia&#x2019;s Nationally Determined Contributions (NDCs) on the transformation of the forestry sector and reforestation to meet targets on emission reduction and to promote sustainable social and economic development.</narrative>
  </description>
